### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminToken = {{login_response.accessToken}}
@tenantId = {{tenant_response.id}}

### 1. Create Tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "New Test Company",
  "domain": "newtest.tsp.local",
  "status": "TRIAL",
  "plan": "BASIC",
  "contactEmail": "admin@newtest.com",
  "contactPerson": "Test Admin",
  "contactPhone": "+90 555 123 4567",
  "city": "Istanbul",
  "country": "Turkey",
  "industry": "FMCG",
  "maxUsers": 10,
  "maxStorageGB": 50,
  "settings": {
    "defaultCurrency": "TRY",
    "fiscalYearStart": "01-01",
    "timezone": "Europe/Istanbul",
    "features": {
      "advancedAnalytics": false,
      "apiAccess": true
    }
  }
}

### 2. Get All Tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Get Tenant By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Update Tenant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "plan": "PROFESSIONAL",
  "maxUsers": 50
}

### 5. Activate Tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Suspend Tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Get Tenant Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Delete Tenant (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

